id: ddg-results
section: Sites
item: DuckDuckGo's regular results page renders its results (T-498/T-499)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-card-events.html
kit: cavekit-modern-web.md R2
needs: internet
launch https://duckduckgo.com/?q=webOS&ia=web 60
wait line 'titleAndUrl title=.*webOS' 30
expect content 0,100,756,900 'sel:body'
